#, fuzzy
msgid "We need more Extension codestarts!"
msgstr "我们需要更多的Extension codestarts!"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Codestarts are designed to make it easy and quick to provide new examples for extensions. So whether you are an extension owner, or you are keen to create an example for an extension you like, contributions are very welcome!"
msgstr "Codestarts的设计是为了使提供新的扩展实例变得简单而快速。因此，无论你是一个扩展的拥有者，还是你热衷于为你喜欢的扩展创建一个例子，我们都非常欢迎你的贡献!"
